      meanEn: 'This cluster sets “discipline” and “joy” side by side, reminding us they aren’t opposites. Real love is not permissiveness but the willingness to do the hard work of guidance for a child’s long-term good; and when someone we love walks in wisdom, the joy runs deep and real. The aim of discipline was never control but rescue and blessing.',
      forMeZh: '无论是对孩子还是对自己，我是把“管教”当成惩罚，还是当成出于爱的拯救？我能否为所爱之人的成长，甘心付出引导的辛劳？',
