    promptsEn: ['What does “buy the truth” mean?', 'Why does the Bible warn against wearing yourself out to get rich?', 'How should a Christian deal with envy?', 'What does the Bible say about disciplining children — isn’t it harsh?', 'What does the Bible say about drunkenness and addiction?'],
